    /// component in plane 2. The horizontal and vertical dimensions of the R and B planes are
    /// halved relative to the image dimensions, and each R and B component is shared with the G
    /// components for which `\left\lfloor i_G \times 0.5 \right\rfloor = i_B = i_R` and
